(6292679, 931267, 98022, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Detail under the vehicle is awesome and I really like the HDR/Topaz effect. IMHO, would have been better for this challenge if the wheel/tire was more prominant in the frame. Maybe if the wheel was turned to the right so that the tire was more in the middle of the frame. Looks like the vehicle may be jacked up so that the wheel could be rotated to simulate vehicle movement (trees are not blurred). Burning of the sky is a little un-natural looking. Overall a great shot.</td>', 'Cool shot! Detail under the vehicle is awesome and I really like the HDR/Topaz effect. IMHO, would have been better for this challenge if the wheel/tire was more prominant in the frame. Maybe if the wheel was turned to the right so that the tire was more in the middle of the frame. Looks like the vehicle may be jacked up so that the wheel could be rotated to simulate vehicle movement (trees are not blurred). Burning of the sky is a little un-natural looking. Overall a great shot.', '2011-01-24 12:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
