(6292964, 931215, 126722, '<td valign="top">at first i didn''t like the it, then the more i looked i enjoyed the reflection of the bike with the dominating tire on the right side of the frame.  <br/> <br/>pretty cool shot.</td>', 'at first i didn''t like the it, then the more i looked i enjoyed the reflection of the bike with the dominating tire on the right side of the frame.   pretty cool shot.', '2011-01-24 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
