(6292972, 930900, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice photo, composition and dof.  I would have loved a bit more light on the slats of the wheel, they are interesting to look at, but lost in the darkness on your shot.</td>', 'nice photo, composition and dof.  I would have loved a bit more light on the slats of the wheel, they are interesting to look at, but lost in the darkness on your shot.', '2011-01-24 17:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
