(6292975, 931568, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. I recognize Seattle but that must be a fairly recent addition. Pretty cool shot. Composition works well and the blue is electric. Title is great as well.</td>', 'Hmmmm. I recognize Seattle but that must be a fairly recent addition. Pretty cool shot. Composition works well and the blue is electric. Title is great as well.', '2011-01-24 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
