(6293024, 931463, 126722, '<td valign="top">the focus is a bit soft for my taste, but it is an interesting object.</td>', 'the focus is a bit soft for my taste, but it is an interesting object.', '2011-01-24 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293025, 930547, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite a capture. Well spotted. Colors and tones are great. I honestly would have gone a bit more contrasty and darker, but that''s my personal preference and this is done quite well.</td>', 'Quite a capture. Well spotted. Colors and tones are great. I honestly would have gone a bit more contrasty and darker, but that''s my personal preference and this is done quite well.', '2011-01-24 18:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293026, 931139, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Sharp image with lovely rich colors and tones. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Sharp image with lovely rich colors and tones. Very nice.', '2011-01-24 18:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293029, 931578, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field, but I feel like it is not the best angle and there is a better shot to be had from the scooter.</td>', 'nice depth of field, but I feel like it is not the best angle and there is a better shot to be had from the scooter.', '2011-01-24 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293030, 931434, 126722, '<td valign="top">interesting wheels, would have worked better if you were a bit higher i think.</td>', 'interesting wheels, would have worked better if you were a bit higher i think.', '2011-01-24 18:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293031, 931723, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. I''m slightly undecided on the tone mapping. It''s given a bit of an unnatural look to the tire and quite a bit of haloing around the roof. It still works, and maybe even moreso for some viewers, but I think I would have played with the sliders in Photomatix or whatever you used to do this and decreased the strength and increased the smoothness. That can often eliminate the halos. Great perspective though.</td>', 'Great perspective. I''m slightly undecided on the tone mapping. It''s given a bit of an unnatural look to the tire and quite a bit of haloing around the roof. It still works, and maybe even moreso for some viewers, but I think I would have played with the sliders in Photomatix or whatever you used to do this and decreased the strength and increased the smoothness. That can often eliminate the halos. Great perspective though.', '2011-01-24 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293033, 931189, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I was planning to do a similar shot with my boss''s maserati but his rims were dirty. This is silky smooth and sharp and extremely well exposed/lit. Nice job.</td>', 'Sweet. I was planning to do a similar shot with my boss''s maserati but his rims were dirty. This is silky smooth and sharp and extremely well exposed/lit. Nice job.', '2011-01-24 18:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293043, 931508, 126722, '<td valign="top">interesting symmetry</td>', 'interesting symmetry', '2011-01-24 18:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293044, 930946, 126722, '<td valign="top">i love the inside of clocks, nice DOF</td>', 'i love the inside of clocks, nice DOF', '2011-01-24 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293045, 931074, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice crop haha</td>', 'nice crop haha', '2011-01-24 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293051, 931573, 126722, '<td valign="top">the sky is a bit blown out and lifeless, but other than that it is a nice shot</td>', 'the sky is a bit blown out and lifeless, but other than that it is a nice shot', '2011-01-24 18:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293052, 931151, 126722, '<td valign="top">the guy in the white shirt is thinking "dude what the heck are you taking a photo of" haha, nice job</td>', 'the guy in the white shirt is thinking "dude what the heck are you taking a photo of" haha, nice job', '2011-01-24 18:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293055, 931715, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice job with the b/w</td>', 'nice job with the b/w', '2011-01-24 18:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293057, 931523, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice angle, perfect exposure</td>', 'nice angle, perfect exposure', '2011-01-24 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293059, 931544, 126722, '<td valign="top">how i love Landrover Defenders....you should win just for that!  would have made a great HDR, but nice exposure regardless.</td>', 'how i love Landrover Defenders....you should win just for that!  would have made a great HDR, but nice exposure regardless.', '2011-01-24 18:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293061, 930547, 126722, '<td valign="top">I love old things like that tractor.....nice HDR but i think it needs a touch more contrast.</td>', 'I love old things like that tractor.....nice HDR but i think it needs a touch more contrast.', '2011-01-24 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293113, 931211, 126722, '<td valign="top">i wanted to take a photo of a pin wheel.....couldn''t find one in time for the challenge.  i''m glad someone did. nice shot</td>', 'i wanted to take a photo of a pin wheel.....couldn''t find one in time for the challenge.  i''m glad someone did. nice shot', '2011-01-24 19:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293117, 931498, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice shot, nice composition.</td>', 'nice shot, nice composition.', '2011-01-24 19:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293119, 930988, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice way of using the wheels to frame the shot.  i love the dark imagery in it</td>', 'nice way of using the wheels to frame the shot.  i love the dark imagery in it', '2011-01-24 19:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293120, 931516, 126722, '<td valign="top">i love steam train wheels, glad you got to shoot them.  nice job on the black and white....image looks good</td>', 'i love steam train wheels, glad you got to shoot them.  nice job on the black and white....image looks good', '2011-01-24 19:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293126, 931195, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2011-01-24 20:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293127, 931470, 126722, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2011-01-24 20:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293156, 931056, 124982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this picture...the exposure/PP is perfect on this!</td>', 'Absolutely love this picture...the exposure/PP is perfect on this!', '2011-01-24 21:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293173, 931199, 124982, '<td valign="top">Elegant, simple and a great example of minimalist viewpoint -- super photo!</td>', 'Elegant, simple and a great example of minimalist viewpoint -- super photo!', '2011-01-24 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293177, 931508, 124982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how I feel about this one. It''s definitely more "arty" than most of the other submissions, which is neither good nor bad. What I just cant figure out is where my eyes are supposed to rest. First they go to the girl, then to the wheel and then to the painting. I think the painting and the wheel compliment one another superbly, and would do great together as a "minimalist" duo, but in honesty I feel the girl is a distraction. Nonetheless, I gave a 7 :)</td>', 'I don''t know how I feel about this one. It''s definitely more "arty" than most of the other submissions, which is neither good nor bad. What I just cant figure out is where my eyes are supposed to rest. First they go to the girl, then to the wheel and then to the painting. I think the painting and the wheel compliment one another superbly, and would do great together as a "minimalist" duo, but in honesty I feel the girl is a distraction. Nonetheless, I gave a 7 :)', '2011-01-24 21:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293178, 931715, 124982, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been a really nice photo if the focus was a little better!</td>', 'This would''ve been a really nice photo if the focus was a little better!', '2011-01-24 21:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293180, 931523, 124982, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this picture, and the contrast between the blacks and whites. I think the photo could have benefitted from a tighter crop though.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this picture, and the contrast between the blacks and whites. I think the photo could have benefitted from a tighter crop though.', '2011-01-24 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293183, 931704, 124982, '<td valign="top">I really like this long-exposure picture!! However, I feel like the exposure was too long in that you lose any detail of the area between the hub and the rim. It''s almost like the rim is floating, which is maybe the effect you were going for?</td>', 'I really like this long-exposure picture!! However, I feel like the exposure was too long in that you lose any detail of the area between the hub and the rim. It''s almost like the rim is floating, which is maybe the effect you were going for?', '2011-01-24 21:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293184, 931408, 124982, '<td valign="top">Photo seems a little too busy, the eyes wonder all over the picture without ever settling on anything. Perhaps a tighter crop around the first 4-5 cyclists would''ve been nicer.</td>', 'Photo seems a little too busy, the eyes wonder all over the picture without ever settling on anything. Perhaps a tighter crop around the first 4-5 cyclists would''ve been nicer.', '2011-01-24 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293185, 931453, 124982, '<td valign="top">I think the subject and composition are good, but the quick shutter speed robs it of any dynamic feel...a nice blur with a longer exposure would''ve been great! Also, the desaturated look detracts from the vibrant feel that this could have.</td>', 'I think the subject and composition are good, but the quick shutter speed robs it of any dynamic feel...a nice blur with a longer exposure would''ve been great! Also, the desaturated look detracts from the vibrant feel that this could have.', '2011-01-24 21:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293195, 931224, 124982, '<td valign="top">Love the close-up viewpoint showing the rust and wear. Top 5 on my list. <br/>EDIT: each time I scan over my votes, my eye is drawn to this thumbnail..I wish I knew why this picture is so magnetic. Maybe the color, or the texture...really a beautiful picture..well deserved the 8!</td>', 'Love the close-up viewpoint showing the rust and wear. Top 5 on my list. EDIT: each time I scan over my votes, my eye is drawn to this thumbnail..I wish I knew why this picture is so magnetic. Maybe the color, or the texture...really a beautiful picture..well deserved the 8!', '2011-01-24 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293196, 931506, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and subdued lighting...top 5 in my books! <br/>Edit: just love the grain and detail in the wheel...wonder what PP was used to help bring that out! Superb photo!</td>', 'Lovely texture and subdued lighting...top 5 in my books! Edit: just love the grain and detail in the wheel...wonder what PP was used to help bring that out! Superb photo!', '2011-01-24 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293199, 931121, 124982, '<td valign="top">Appreciate the alternative interpretation of the challenge. Wonderfully executed composition and use of B&amp;W. Top 5 on my list.<br/>Edit: the simplistic composition of this is just super. I love B&amp;W photos and identify with this one a lot.<br/>Just cant figure out whether I prefer the needle arm out of focus or not? Nonetheless, well deserving of the 8 :)</td>', 'Appreciate the alternative interpretation of the challenge. Wonderfully executed composition and use of B&W. Top 5 on my list.Edit: the simplistic composition of this is just super. I love B&W photos and identify with this one a lot.Just cant figure out whether I prefer the needle arm out of focus or not? Nonetheless, well deserving of the 8 :)', '2011-01-24 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293200, 931573, 124982, '<td valign="top">I think there''s so much detail and texture in this wheel, but it''s just so far away. Wish we were cropped in tighter to the wheel so we could fully appreciate the aged nature of this wonderful relic!</td>', 'I think there''s so much detail and texture in this wheel, but it''s just so far away. Wish we were cropped in tighter to the wheel so we could fully appreciate the aged nature of this wonderful relic!', '2011-01-24 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293201, 931409, 124982, '<td valign="top">I was expecting to see a lot of these style photo''s in this challenge, but suprisingly there were very few! However, this is the best of the bunch and an excellent photo --- the colors are wonderfully vibrant and vivid!</td>', 'I was expecting to see a lot of these style photo''s in this challenge, but suprisingly there were very few! However, this is the best of the bunch and an excellent photo --- the colors are wonderfully vibrant and vivid!', '2011-01-24 22:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293211, 931486, 124982, '<td valign="top">In all honesty, I originally just gave this a 6. But I''ve spent some time looking at it, and found so much more to this photo than I saw in my initial pass-through. Just love the shapes and contours of this structure, and the use of B&amp;W was inspired. Only thing I would "recommend" is to drop the exposure on the sky a little bit (either a graduated filter or some burning) to really bring out the structure and let it stand out more. Irrespective of that one comment, I have revised my initial score and given this an 8. Well done!</td>', 'In all honesty, I originally just gave this a 6. But I''ve spent some time looking at it, and found so much more to this photo than I saw in my initial pass-through. Just love the shapes and contours of this structure, and the use of B&W was inspired. Only thing I would "recommend" is to drop the exposure on the sky a little bit (either a graduated filter or some burning) to really bring out the structure and let it stand out more. Irrespective of that one comment, I have revised my initial score and given this an 8. Well done!', '2011-01-24 22:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293212, 930547, 124982, '<td valign="top">The perfect candidate for some tonemapping and HDR...although feel it''s resulted in a slightly painterly look, so gave this a 6 instead of a 7. Perhaps that was what you were going for? If this isn''t HDR, and I''ve interpreted this incorrectly, my sincerest apologies!</td>', 'The perfect candidate for some tonemapping and HDR...although feel it''s resulted in a slightly painterly look, so gave this a 6 instead of a 7. Perhaps that was what you were going for? If this isn''t HDR, and I''ve interpreted this incorrectly, my sincerest apologies!', '2011-01-24 22:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293213, 931241, 124982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adore the bright red and how they stand out from the surrounding! Just beautiful...and well, almost fairy-tale like!</td>', 'Absolutely adore the bright red and how they stand out from the surrounding! Just beautiful...and well, almost fairy-tale like!', '2011-01-24 22:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293216, 931419, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really appreciate this different take on the challenge! Wonderful thinking outside of the proverbial box! Think it would''ve scored a point higher for me if the crop was much tighter on the wheel. Wonderful picture nonetheless!</td>', 'Really appreciate this different take on the challenge! Wonderful thinking outside of the proverbial box! Think it would''ve scored a point higher for me if the crop was much tighter on the wheel. Wonderful picture nonetheless!', '2011-01-24 22:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
