(6293361, 931511, 108069, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of that riddle of how the two thieves got 52 bicycles out of the bike shop without opening any windows or doors. I was young and impressed at the time.<br/> <br/>I think this image has real promise. It''s a very interesting scene and though while a bit cluttered, that''s the entire point. If there are two things I would have done with it, however, it would be to try to get a bit more range out of it with some tone mapping and/or blend of multiple exposures. Nothing cartoonish, but there are a load of blue hues here that would make it very nice. Also, I''d run a gaussian blur or some noise reduction software, as it seems slightly noisy. Interesting scene though.</td>', 'This reminds me of that riddle of how the two thieves got 52 bicycles out of the bike shop without opening any windows or doors. I was young and impressed at the time. I think this image has real promise. It''s a very interesting scene and though while a bit cluttered, that''s the entire point. If there are two things I would have done with it, however, it would be to try to get a bit more range out of it with some tone mapping and/or blend of multiple exposures. Nothing cartoonish, but there are a load of blue hues here that would make it very nice. Also, I''d run a gaussian blur or some noise reduction software, as it seems slightly noisy. Interesting scene though.', '2011-01-25 04:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293367, 931204, 115345, '<td valign="top">love the movement, energy and joy you have captured in this - 9</td>', 'love the movement, energy and joy you have captured in this - 9', '2011-01-25 05:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
