(6293387, 930746, 115345, '<td valign="top">9 - I really like this, tells a story but leaves much room for imagination, I love how you have created a triangle arrangement out of the wheel and foot and how you have created great atmosphere by not having a sharp image (which would have destroyed the effect for me)</td>', '9 - I really like this, tells a story but leaves much room for imagination, I love how you have created a triangle arrangement out of the wheel and foot and how you have created great atmosphere by not having a sharp image (which would have destroyed the effect for me)', '2011-01-25 05:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
