(6293389, 931485, 115345, '<td valign="top">8 - great image, I like the balance of bold shapes giving way to more ethereal stuff up the top and how the colours are not garish.  A very nicely done abstract, pleasing on the eye.</td>', '8 - great image, I like the balance of bold shapes giving way to more ethereal stuff up the top and how the colours are not garish.  A very nicely done abstract, pleasing on the eye.', '2011-01-25 05:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
