(6293392, 931219, 115345, '<td valign="top">7 - well balanced, strong composition, I would have preferred it if you could have captured a bit more tonal range as the highlights at the top left are blown but that is just me (and you may have done this deliberately anyway)</td>', '7 - well balanced, strong composition, I would have preferred it if you could have captured a bit more tonal range as the highlights at the top left are blown but that is just me (and you may have done this deliberately anyway)', '2011-01-25 05:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293393, 931453, 115345, '<td valign="top">7 - great composition, captures both the elegance of the structure and the sense of vertical scale by the viewpoint you have chosen.</td>', '7 - great composition, captures both the elegance of the structure and the sense of vertical scale by the viewpoint you have chosen.', '2011-01-25 05:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293394, 931078, 115345, '<td valign="top">4 - I found it a bit cluttered and the composition felt to me ''unbalanced'' with no clear centre of interest and too much going on.  Also I found the slight blurry-ness slightly off putting (sharpness isn''t always necessary depending on the effect you are after but in this image I think a sharper image would have lifted it a point or two by my taste).  Everyone''s taste is different though - if you like the effect then that is what matters.</td>', '4 - I found it a bit cluttered and the composition felt to me ''unbalanced'' with no clear centre of interest and too much going on.  Also I found the slight blurry-ness slightly off putting (sharpness isn''t always necessary depending on the effect you are after but in this image I think a sharper image would have lifted it a point or two by my taste).  Everyone''s taste is different though - if you like the effect then that is what matters.', '2011-01-25 05:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293395, 931608, 115345, '<td valign="top">4 - sorry, it just doesn''t grab me, no real point of interest or structure in the composition to draw me in.  It is not quite abstract enough to be a pleasing set of shapes and tones and yet not quite realistic enough to be interesting as an object... perhaps if you used a slightly different viewpoint than straight on to the wheels to get more curves/intrigue happening?  That is my taste - if you were after the effect you got and it works for you then that is what matters</td>', '4 - sorry, it just doesn''t grab me, no real point of interest or structure in the composition to draw me in.  It is not quite abstract enough to be a pleasing set of shapes and tones and yet not quite realistic enough to be interesting as an object... perhaps if you used a slightly different viewpoint than straight on to the wheels to get more curves/intrigue happening?  That is my taste - if you were after the effect you got and it works for you then that is what matters', '2011-01-25 05:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293398, 931199, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cold and hard and sharp and mechanical. Great feeling to this. Nice composition and contrast.</td>', 'Cold and hard and sharp and mechanical. Great feeling to this. Nice composition and contrast.', '2011-01-25 06:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
