(6293431, 931128, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the shot a lot, but it doesn''t scream "wheels" to me.  They''re hardly the subject.</td>', 'I like the shot a lot, but it doesn''t scream "wheels" to me.  They''re hardly the subject.', '2011-01-25 07:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293434, 931529, 108069, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and while slightly distracting it''s a cool focal point and interesting image. Great contrast.</td>', 'Interesting composition and while slightly distracting it''s a cool focal point and interesting image. Great contrast.', '2011-01-25 07:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293439, 931211, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever. I''m not entirely sold on the shallow depth of field, however. On the one hand I like the dream quality it gives the image, and it certainly places focus on the pinwheel, yet on the other the photo seems a bit off balance because of the clarity in the needles and ground.<br/> <br/>I typically like a wide range of exposure values, but I think the clarity and lighting on the ground is not helping you that much. It''s not really interesting for the image, and is actually distracting.<br/> <br/>Try this with a square crop starting from the top of your image and I think it would be excellent. It would eliminate the distracting ground and really frame the pinwheel. The rest is really well done and creative.</td>', 'Clever. I''m not entirely sold on the shallow depth of field, however. On the one hand I like the dream quality it gives the image, and it certainly places focus on the pinwheel, yet on the other the photo seems a bit off balance because of the clarity in the needles and ground. I typically like a wide range of exposure values, but I think the clarity and lighting on the ground is not helping you that much. It''s not really interesting for the image, and is actually distracting. Try this with a square crop starting from the top of your image and I think it would be excellent. It would eliminate the distracting ground and really frame the pinwheel. The rest is really well done and creative.', '2011-01-25 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293442, 931121, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. Appreciated. Perfect focal point. Nice tones, great perspective. Well framed. Great entry.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. Appreciated. Perfect focal point. Nice tones, great perspective. Well framed. Great entry.', '2011-01-25 07:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293453, 931056, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp, lively motion with electric color. Great idea, and brings a lot of action to what has been ironically largely presented as a static subject. Very well done.</td>', 'Nice sharp, lively motion with electric color. Great idea, and brings a lot of action to what has been ironically largely presented as a static subject. Very well done.', '2011-01-25 08:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293474, 930988, 54645, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea, bizarre comp, which is an instant attraction, well done 9</td>', 'fantastic idea, bizarre comp, which is an instant attraction, well done 9', '2011-01-25 08:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293490, 931486, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating. I just looked this up because I had honestly never heard of it before. What a feat of engineering, and perfectly represented here. Fantastic composition and great treatment of tones and processing. One of the more striking images to begin with, but also done really well and an interesting story. Sweet.</td>', 'This is fascinating. I just looked this up because I had honestly never heard of it before. What a feat of engineering, and perfectly represented here. Fantastic composition and great treatment of tones and processing. One of the more striking images to begin with, but also done really well and an interesting story. Sweet.', '2011-01-25 09:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293493, 931520, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene. Truly perfectly illuminated in every way. Crisp and sharp. Great colors and composition. And to be honest I don''t think I''ve seen it represented any better. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful scene. Truly perfectly illuminated in every way. Crisp and sharp. Great colors and composition. And to be honest I don''t think I''ve seen it represented any better. Nicely done.', '2011-01-25 09:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
