(6293499, 931056, 126722, '<td valign="top">interesting subject to shoot....I think it would be a bit better if it was shot from a different angle instead of head on.<br/> <br/>nice shutter speed, enough motion to see the sparks, but not too much that it becomes a blurry mess....good job.</td>', 'interesting subject to shoot....I think it would be a bit better if it was shot from a different angle instead of head on. nice shutter speed, enough motion to see the sparks, but not too much that it becomes a blurry mess....good job.', '2011-01-25 09:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
