(6293792, 931202, 108069, '<td valign="top">Extremely well executed and a nice spin on the challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'Extremely well executed and a nice spin on the challenge. Nicely done.', '2011-01-25 15:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293793, 931578, 108069, '<td valign="top">Looks almost 3D. Nice composition. Not outrageously exciting, but technically good.</td>', 'Looks almost 3D. Nice composition. Not outrageously exciting, but technically good.', '2011-01-25 15:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293796, 931573, 108069, '<td valign="top">Oldtimer. Great composition. What would have turned this from very good to outstanding, I think, is a bit of tone mapping or some other trick to get a wider range of exposure so the sky isn''t so white. having written that I realize the sky hasn''t been anything <i>but</i> white for the past, oh, three months here, but still it seems just a bit too bright.<br/> <br/>I love the moss and the texture of the wheel though. I also like how it''s jacked up with a stone. Nice find. Well done.</td>', 'Oldtimer. Great composition. What would have turned this from very good to outstanding, I think, is a bit of tone mapping or some other trick to get a wider range of exposure so the sky isn''t so white. having written that I realize the sky hasn''t been anything but white for the past, oh, three months here, but still it seems just a bit too bright. I love the moss and the texture of the wheel though. I also like how it''s jacked up with a stone. Nice find. Well done.', '2011-01-25 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293797, 931715, 108069, '<td valign="top">The detail in the snow crystals is nice. I can feel the cold. Composition is good. Interesting perspective.</td>', 'The detail in the snow crystals is nice. I can feel the cold. Composition is good. Interesting perspective.', '2011-01-25 15:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293798, 931011, 108069, '<td valign="top">Precision photograph of a precision piece. Smooth, crisp and clear. Professional photo. Very well done.</td>', 'Precision photograph of a precision piece. Smooth, crisp and clear. Professional photo. Very well done.', '2011-01-25 15:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293837, 931551, 30214, '<td valign="top">vintage feel is nicely communicated</td>', 'vintage feel is nicely communicated', '2011-01-25 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293890, 931141, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Wonderful composition and truly clever idea. Technical stuff is without question perfect. Very professional photo.</td>', 'Great shot. Wonderful composition and truly clever idea. Technical stuff is without question perfect. Very professional photo.', '2011-01-25 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293917, 931530, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and nice texture in the wood. Rich color contrasted against the pure white snow. Nice detail to the snow on the wheels. Great depth. Very, very nice shot that honestly gets better the more time I spend with it. Very well done.</td>', 'Nicely composed and nice texture in the wood. Rich color contrasted against the pure white snow. Nice detail to the snow on the wheels. Great depth. Very, very nice shot that honestly gets better the more time I spend with it. Very well done.', '2011-01-25 17:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293926, 931278, 108069, '<td valign="top">John Deer comin'' through! Nice shot. Motion in the tractor but the hills in the distance are crystal clear. Nice depth. Those are meaty tires. Great entry.</td>', 'John Deer comin'' through! Nice shot. Motion in the tractor but the hills in the distance are crystal clear. Nice depth. Those are meaty tires. Great entry.', '2011-01-25 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293943, 931078, 108069, '<td valign="top">A very nice scene. But it does look a bit as though you''ve clipped it from an old pamphlet advertising the Mosel river tributaries. It seems slightly dark and slightly soft. Maybe even a slightly different composition would have helped a bit. The intention is excellent, and there''s great potential here, but it definitely needs some fine tuning.</td>', 'A very nice scene. But it does look a bit as though you''ve clipped it from an old pamphlet advertising the Mosel river tributaries. It seems slightly dark and slightly soft. Maybe even a slightly different composition would have helped a bit. The intention is excellent, and there''s great potential here, but it definitely needs some fine tuning.', '2011-01-25 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293944, 931713, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and cute photo. Sharp, well framed with the lined table cloth, nice contrast in colors. It''s difficult to get excited by cereal, but this is a very professional photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice composition and cute photo. Sharp, well framed with the lined table cloth, nice contrast in colors. It''s difficult to get excited by cereal, but this is a very professional photo. Nice job.', '2011-01-25 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293948, 931433, 108069, '<td valign="top">Speed indeed. Nice motion yet sharp. I think my wheel would have been a lot more out of balance had I tried this with my bike. Interesting how the tire is a completely smooth blur. Not sure I ever go that fast. Good shot.</td>', 'Speed indeed. Nice motion yet sharp. I think my wheel would have been a lot more out of balance had I tried this with my bike. Interesting how the tire is a completely smooth blur. Not sure I ever go that fast. Good shot.', '2011-01-25 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293955, 930972, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted and nice composition. I think it could use a bit of an exposure pop, be it tone mapping or something, to separate the subject from the sky and grass, but it''s certainly a great subject.</td>', 'Well spotted and nice composition. I think it could use a bit of an exposure pop, be it tone mapping or something, to separate the subject from the sky and grass, but it''s certainly a great subject.', '2011-01-25 18:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293956, 931605, 119667, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for longer than any other photo in the challenge and couldn''t figure it out. I could pretend I get it and vote high, but then I''d be kidding myself. I could admit I don''t get it and vote low, but that would be mean. So I''m not voting. But well done for expressing yourself.</td>', 'I looked at this for longer than any other photo in the challenge and couldn''t figure it out. I could pretend I get it and vote high, but then I''d be kidding myself. I could admit I don''t get it and vote low, but that would be mean. So I''m not voting. But well done for expressing yourself.', '2011-01-25 18:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293960, 931501, 108069, '<td valign="top">Bizarre and creepy and I''m not intelligent enough to figure out what it is, and maybe that''s best so the imagination has no leash. I won''t bore you with my thoughts, but it''s awesome. (The photo, not my thoughts.) Wonderful tones. Pressing and disturbing.</td>', 'Bizarre and creepy and I''m not intelligent enough to figure out what it is, and maybe that''s best so the imagination has no leash. I won''t bore you with my thoughts, but it''s awesome. (The photo, not my thoughts.) Wonderful tones. Pressing and disturbing.', '2011-01-25 18:29:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6293961, 931218, 119667, '<td valign="top">great tones</td>', 'great tones', '2011-01-25 18:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293964, 931089, 119667, '<td valign="top">cool shapes and tones</td>', 'cool shapes and tones', '2011-01-25 18:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293966, 931486, 119667, '<td valign="top">lovely symmetry and BW treatment</td>', 'lovely symmetry and BW treatment', '2011-01-25 18:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293967, 931089, 108069, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a spiral staircase. Interesting photo that looks extremely fake until you shift your eyes just a bit and realize it''s 100% legit and it''s just contrast playing with your mind. Nice cracks in the tire. Cool photo.</td>', 'Reminds me of a spiral staircase. Interesting photo that looks extremely fake until you shift your eyes just a bit and realize it''s 100% legit and it''s just contrast playing with your mind. Nice cracks in the tire. Cool photo.', '2011-01-25 18:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293968, 931473, 119667, '<td valign="top">a lot of bike wheels in this challenge, this is one of the simplest and one of the best</td>', 'a lot of bike wheels in this challenge, this is one of the simplest and one of the best', '2011-01-25 18:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293969, 931537, 108069, '<td valign="top">This for me is just too much processing. I do like the brake discs shining through, but otherwise it needs more contrast to be interesting. Maybe inverted.</td>', 'This for me is just too much processing. I do like the brake discs shining through, but otherwise it needs more contrast to be interesting. Maybe inverted.', '2011-01-25 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293970, 931409, 119667, '<td valign="top">great shot. interesting crop choice.</td>', 'great shot. interesting crop choice.', '2011-01-25 18:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293971, 930997, 108069, '<td valign="top">Big story and interesting scene. Nice tones. Lacking in some other areas, but an interesting entry.</td>', 'Big story and interesting scene. Nice tones. Lacking in some other areas, but an interesting entry.', '2011-01-25 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293974, 931456, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great motion. I''d love a levels or curves adjust to get a wider range of tones as well as more contrast. But it''s pretty cool the way it is as well.</td>', 'Great motion. I''d love a levels or curves adjust to get a wider range of tones as well as more contrast. But it''s pretty cool the way it is as well.', '2011-01-25 18:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293977, 930988, 82282, '<td valign="top">This photo definitely made me do a double take</td>', 'This photo definitely made me do a double take', '2011-01-25 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293978, 931419, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the theme. Unique for the challenge. Super sharp, interestingly composed. Nice one.</td>', 'Nice take on the theme. Unique for the challenge. Super sharp, interestingly composed. Nice one.', '2011-01-25 18:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293979, 931537, 82282, '<td valign="top">I think the editing technique takes away from the photo.  After looking again, I can now see that this is a Porsche rim.</td>', 'I think the editing technique takes away from the photo.  After looking again, I can now see that this is a Porsche rim.', '2011-01-25 18:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293980, 931485, 82282, '<td valign="top">Very artistic, but I''m not sure what to focus on here.  Maybe it''s a good thing, but maybe it''s not.  For me though, I don''t get it.  But then again in "art" you''re not always supposed to get it right?</td>', 'Very artistic, but I''m not sure what to focus on here.  Maybe it''s a good thing, but maybe it''s not.  For me though, I don''t get it.  But then again in "art" you''re not always supposed to get it right?', '2011-01-25 18:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293985, 931548, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and wonderful focus throughout the photo. Vibrant colors. Nice.</td>', 'Nice composition and wonderful focus throughout the photo. Vibrant colors. Nice.', '2011-01-25 18:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293988, 931266, 82282, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, just not digging the post processing.</td>', 'Cool idea, just not digging the post processing.', '2011-01-25 18:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293990, 930946, 108069, '<td valign="top">Delicate, simple and beautiful. Lovely entry. Only thing I would have done differently is to have put the shallow focus on one of the gears or gone with a deeper focus for the entire image. The more I look at it the focal depth isn''t that shallow, so the OOF section toward the front may have been too close for the focal range of the lens. I''m just speculating. I still love the image.</td>', 'Delicate, simple and beautiful. Lovely entry. Only thing I would have done differently is to have put the shallow focus on one of the gears or gone with a deeper focus for the entire image. The more I look at it the focal depth isn''t that shallow, so the OOF section toward the front may have been too close for the focal range of the lens. I''m just speculating. I still love the image.', '2011-01-25 18:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293994, 931204, 82282, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s my eye or monitor.  I love the image, just not the processing of the face.  For some reason the person''s face looks overprocessed.  Maybe it''s a tad too sharp for web resolution?  Overall though, great execution, great technique.</td>', 'Maybe it''s my eye or monitor.  I love the image, just not the processing of the face.  For some reason the person''s face looks overprocessed.  Maybe it''s a tad too sharp for web resolution?  Overall though, great execution, great technique.', '2011-01-25 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293998, 931506, 82282, '<td valign="top">I like the wheel itself, just not enjoying what looks to be over-vignetting on the image.</td>', 'I like the wheel itself, just not enjoying what looks to be over-vignetting on the image.', '2011-01-25 19:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294005, 931596, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. Wonderful depth where it would almost seem impossible. Yet I can clearly see eight wheels deep. Impressive. Great clarity, sharpness, texture in the tire. Tonal range is great. Very well done.</td>', 'This is quite nice. Wonderful depth where it would almost seem impossible. Yet I can clearly see eight wheels deep. Impressive. Great clarity, sharpness, texture in the tire. Tonal range is great. Very well done.', '2011-01-25 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294007, 931521, 82282, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind overblown highlights that much compared to others, especially if it''s done on purpose.  But in this case, I would tone it down a bit.  The wheels and the person are competing with attention.</td>', 'I don''t mind overblown highlights that much compared to others, especially if it''s done on purpose.  But in this case, I would tone it down a bit.  The wheels and the person are competing with attention.', '2011-01-25 19:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294008, 931011, 82282, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image.</td>', 'Nice clean image.', '2011-01-25 19:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294012, 931056, 82282, '<td valign="top">oooh scary shot.  hope your lens survived.</td>', 'oooh scary shot.  hope your lens survived.', '2011-01-25 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294014, 931544, 82282, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I''d remove the vignetting if possible.</td>', 'Good image.  I''d remove the vignetting if possible.', '2011-01-25 19:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294020, 931509, 82282, '<td valign="top">Experimentation is good!  To me it''s a bit over-saturated, but that might be what you''re looking for.  There might be a little too much going on with lights and colors.  For instance, I don''t think the green lines below add to the overall image.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'Experimentation is good!  To me it''s a bit over-saturated, but that might be what you''re looking for.  There might be a little too much going on with lights and colors.  For instance, I don''t think the green lines below add to the overall image.  Hope this helps.', '2011-01-25 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6294072, 931241, 114285, '<td valign="top">That''s fantastic.</td>', 'That''s fantastic.', '2011-01-25 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
