(6295318, 931720, 86799, '<td valign="top">Such a unique view, sharp, curvy and engaging.  Hope it scores high...may not.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Such a unique view, sharp, curvy and engaging.  Hope it scores high...may not.  I like it a lot.', '2011-01-26 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295497, 930988, 93565, '<td valign="top">An excellent example of how to not capture the exact same bicycle shot over and over again. Not only do the overlapping rims work wonderfully in and of themselves, but the silhouetted riders just take this to the next level. Surely one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'An excellent example of how to not capture the exact same bicycle shot over and over again. Not only do the overlapping rims work wonderfully in and of themselves, but the silhouetted riders just take this to the next level. Surely one of the best of the challenge.', '2011-01-27 02:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295498, 931141, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition, and a slightly different way of looking at two very popular subjects for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition, and a slightly different way of looking at two very popular subjects for the challenge.', '2011-01-27 02:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295499, 931508, 93565, '<td valign="top">What I like most about this is that you''ve managed to reduce the wheel in prominence physically but maintain it conceptually and visually. I very much like the composition, the wheel and the pseudo wheel, and having the girl in the frame really sets this one apart, particularly her reserved pose. One of my favorites.</td>', 'What I like most about this is that you''ve managed to reduce the wheel in prominence physically but maintain it conceptually and visually. I very much like the composition, the wheel and the pseudo wheel, and having the girl in the frame really sets this one apart, particularly her reserved pose. One of my favorites.', '2011-01-27 03:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295500, 930528, 93565, '<td valign="top">You''ve used perspective very effectively to dictate size and importance here, leaving an image that has multiple levels consisting of the same object, but which have a very different feel to each of them.</td>', 'You''ve used perspective very effectively to dictate size and importance here, leaving an image that has multiple levels consisting of the same object, but which have a very different feel to each of them.', '2011-01-27 03:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295501, 931507, 93565, '<td valign="top">Best of the shopping car entries, the alignment is what really does it for me, the arc of wheels. I''m torn on what I think would be the best for DoF, but this works well as is.</td>', 'Best of the shopping car entries, the alignment is what really does it for me, the arc of wheels. I''m torn on what I think would be the best for DoF, but this works well as is.', '2011-01-27 03:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295504, 930746, 93565, '<td valign="top">Huge fan of the simplicity of this shot. Perfect use of contrast to eliminate the unnecessary, leaving the viewer with the only things that matter. I also very much enjoy how you''ve brought a commentary to a hazardously cliche subject matter and elevated it to something wholly different and better. Grain and lack of focus work well here, especially together. Surely one of my favorites.</td>', 'Huge fan of the simplicity of this shot. Perfect use of contrast to eliminate the unnecessary, leaving the viewer with the only things that matter. I also very much enjoy how you''ve brought a commentary to a hazardously cliche subject matter and elevated it to something wholly different and better. Grain and lack of focus work well here, especially together. Surely one of my favorites.', '2011-01-27 03:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295505, 931419, 93565, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this higher simply for the fact that you chose a very different subject matter, but there is much more to this photo than that. The angling of the reel and, really, just the overall composition, is very nice. Though it''s cramped, and busy, it feels so complete and perfect in its arrangement. The converging fishing line is nice, pulling us out of the frame towards the rodtip. I could definitely see this in Field &amp; Stream or Fly Fisherman.</td>', 'I would have voted this higher simply for the fact that you chose a very different subject matter, but there is much more to this photo than that. The angling of the reel and, really, just the overall composition, is very nice. Though it''s cramped, and busy, it feels so complete and perfect in its arrangement. The converging fishing line is nice, pulling us out of the frame towards the rodtip. I could definitely see this in Field & Stream or Fly Fisherman.', '2011-01-27 03:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295506, 931267, 93565, '<td valign="top">Way overcooked, but I''m sure you know that. I like the perspective quite a bit though- a different way of looking at things that most missed.</td>', 'Way overcooked, but I''m sure you know that. I like the perspective quite a bit though- a different way of looking at things that most missed.', '2011-01-27 03:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295507, 931581, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the sprawling spokes, like spider legs.</td>', 'I like the sprawling spokes, like spider legs.', '2011-01-27 03:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295508, 931151, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice job using the theme as a tool for a street capture.</td>', 'Nice job using the theme as a tool for a street capture.', '2011-01-27 03:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295509, 931720, 93565, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Strange. Otherworldly, like a haunting cosmos that lies beneath.<br/>I dig.</td>', 'Spooky. Strange. Otherworldly, like a haunting cosmos that lies beneath.I dig.', '2011-01-27 03:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295510, 931503, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the context you''ve provided us with, something to reflect on other than simply the toy car (as in other shots). Giving or taking, that''s the question.</td>', 'I like the context you''ve provided us with, something to reflect on other than simply the toy car (as in other shots). Giving or taking, that''s the question.', '2011-01-27 03:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295511, 931509, 93565, '<td valign="top">You need to smooth out the lightpainting a little bit, but this is interesting. Definitely potential here, but things seem sorta haphazard, particularly the green laser light. The wall is rather garish, and the composition needs to be strengthened. It''s very static. A lot of that could be alleviated by changing your pov by moving closer, to the left, and lower.</td>', 'You need to smooth out the lightpainting a little bit, but this is interesting. Definitely potential here, but things seem sorta haphazard, particularly the green laser light. The wall is rather garish, and the composition needs to be strengthened. It''s very static. A lot of that could be alleviated by changing your pov by moving closer, to the left, and lower.', '2011-01-27 03:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6295624, 931535, 36843, '<td valign="top">Cool shot</td>', 'Cool shot', '2011-01-27 09:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
