(6296428, 930540, 70503, '<td valign="top">I really love the processing on this. There are so many details to look at. The perspective makes me feel like I am right there in the scene. I love these kinds of shots. Well done.</td>', 'I really love the processing on this. There are so many details to look at. The perspective makes me feel like I am right there in the scene. I love these kinds of shots. Well done.', '2011-01-28 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296429, 931121, 70503, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective. I like the processing as well. The sharpness of the needle head is perfect. Well done!</td>', 'Lovely perspective. I like the processing as well. The sharpness of the needle head is perfect. Well done!', '2011-01-28 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296430, 931723, 70503, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot. The wheel is a bit dark and I feel that the car is more the subject, however, it meets the challenge. I might have cloned out some of the white spots on the tire...they are a bit distracting. I still love the shot and the processing. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot. The wheel is a bit dark and I feel that the car is more the subject, however, it meets the challenge. I might have cloned out some of the white spots on the tire...they are a bit distracting. I still love the shot and the processing. Nicely done.', '2011-01-28 12:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296458, 931595, 70503, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my son. He is forever parking/climbing his 4 wheeler or truck up on something. I like the processing and the way the pic has leading lines. Nice and crisp on the front wheel. Well done.</td>', 'This reminds me of my son. He is forever parking/climbing his 4 wheeler or truck up on something. I like the processing and the way the pic has leading lines. Nice and crisp on the front wheel. Well done.', '2011-01-28 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296460, 931195, 70503, '<td valign="top">At first I couldn''t figure out what I was looking at. It looked like some GIANT rigging for something. *sigh*...must need more coffee. LOL. Anyway, this is really interesting. The processing seems just a bit much for my taste. But still, I like.</td>', 'At first I couldn''t figure out what I was looking at. It looked like some GIANT rigging for something. *sigh*...must need more coffee. LOL. Anyway, this is really interesting. The processing seems just a bit much for my taste. But still, I like.', '2011-01-28 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296464, 931453, 70503, '<td valign="top">MMM I love the processing. It feels GIGANTIC. Very well done!</td>', 'MMM I love the processing. It feels GIGANTIC. Very well done!', '2011-01-28 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296466, 931441, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice sillohuette. I don''t automatically think wheel, but there are wheels in the photo. Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice sillohuette. I don''t automatically think wheel, but there are wheels in the photo. Interesting take on the challenge.', '2011-01-28 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296468, 931221, 70503, '<td valign="top">Yummy black and white. This doesn''t scream Wheel to me, but at the same time, the lines lead you from the wheel of the car out. I love how clean the black and white is whith all the midtones of gray. Nicely done.</td>', 'Yummy black and white. This doesn''t scream Wheel to me, but at the same time, the lines lead you from the wheel of the car out. I love how clean the black and white is whith all the midtones of gray. Nicely done.', '2011-01-28 12:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296471, 931222, 70503, '<td valign="top">Spectacular processing. I love love love this!</td>', 'Spectacular processing. I love love love this!', '2011-01-28 13:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296472, 931548, 70503, '<td valign="top">This is a great image... however, the red border takes away from it. I am definitely not one of the border police and I am rather shocked that a border is bugging me. I would love to see this processed without the red border.</td>', 'This is a great image... however, the red border takes away from it. I am definitely not one of the border police and I am rather shocked that a border is bugging me. I would love to see this processed without the red border.', '2011-01-28 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296473, 931219, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and black and white. Because of the B&amp;W, it feels like an old timey grocery store. I like it.</td>', 'Nice perspective and black and white. Because of the B&W, it feels like an old timey grocery store. I like it.', '2011-01-28 13:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
