(6296495, 930988, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love the grainy and blurriness of this image. Are we looking through a wheel at the riders?</td>', 'I love the grainy and blurriness of this image. Are we looking through a wheel at the riders?', '2011-01-28 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296496, 931530, 124982, '<td valign="top">Apologies for my earlier rating on this..admittedly I originally scored it in the mid-range based on the thumbnail view, but I''ve been going through all the photo''s at full-size today and reworking my votes accordingly, and stumbled across this guy that snuck under the radar! Really love the colors on this one, and the texture of the wood! Such a simple, elegant picture. Think maybe a tighter crop on the front wheel would''ve worked wonderfully, really bringing that wheel to the center of attention, but would also remove the distracting tree from the background. Original score +2!</td>', 'Apologies for my earlier rating on this..admittedly I originally scored it in the mid-range based on the thumbnail view, but I''ve been going through all the photo''s at full-size today and reworking my votes accordingly, and stumbled across this guy that snuck under the radar! Really love the colors on this one, and the texture of the wood! Such a simple, elegant picture. Think maybe a tighter crop on the front wheel would''ve worked wonderfully, really bringing that wheel to the center of attention, but would also remove the distracting tree from the background. Original score +2!', '2011-01-28 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6296497, 931176, 70503, '<td valign="top">I had to google your title. LOL. I don''t see a wheel in this image. I will give you the benefit of my doubt and rate it on merit alone. It is an interesting image, not quite my taste.</td>', 'I had to google your title. LOL. I don''t see a wheel in this image. I will give you the benefit of my doubt and rate it on merit alone. It is an interesting image, not quite my taste.', '2011-01-28 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
