(6297035, 931202, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Can''t see wheels though. I''d imagine that''s hurting the score. But wheels are implied with cars, so that''s not gonna hurt my votin''.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Can''t see wheels though. I''d imagine that''s hurting the score. But wheels are implied with cars, so that''s not gonna hurt my votin''.', '2011-01-29 09:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
