(6297040, 931195, 117474, '<td valign="top">I quite like this... but I don''t think it''ll score too well though :)<br/>I think the biggest scoring factor will be the harsh light. But I kinda like the way the crosses of colours stack on each other...</td>', 'I quite like this... but I don''t think it''ll score too well though :)I think the biggest scoring factor will be the harsh light. But I kinda like the way the crosses of colours stack on each other...', '2011-01-29 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6297045, 931723, 117474, '<td valign="top">It looks like there''s a lot of haloing around the car, and the wheel. It matches the reflections and make the image stand out a bit more, I think. I wonder how many people will say that :)<br/>But, the tyre''s grooves aren''t perfectly crisp, which is a shame. I like the composition of this.</td>', 'It looks like there''s a lot of haloing around the car, and the wheel. It matches the reflections and make the image stand out a bit more, I think. I wonder how many people will say that :)But, the tyre''s grooves aren''t perfectly crisp, which is a shame. I like the composition of this.', '2011-01-29 10:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
