(6298427, 931568, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> There''s a whole generation who would not know what this is ... has never seen a typewriter let alone used one ... couldn''t imagine erasing an ink letter on paper rather than pressing the backspace key.<br/> <br/>Nice shot of my favorite city by the way! Composition is perfect. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>apparently at 41 yrs old I am part of that generation :) I had no idea what it was til Ken told me....i thought it was some kind of crazy pizza cutter!</td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: There''s a whole generation who would not know what this is ... has never seen a typewriter let alone used one ... couldn''t imagine erasing an ink letter on paper rather than pressing the backspace key. Nice shot of my favorite city by the way! Composition is perfect.   apparently at 41 yrs old I am part of that generation :) I had no idea what it was til Ken told me....i thought it was some kind of crazy pizza cutter!', '2011-01-31 10:05:52.000000', NULL, 0),
