(6299687, 931535, 65319, '<td valign="top">How handsome you are as none other than <a href="//www.google.com/imgres?imgurl=//upcomingdiscs.com/ecs_covers/sinbad-of-the-seven-seas-large.jpg&amp;imgrefurl=//upcomingdiscs.com/category/disc-reviews/genre/action/page/12/&amp;h=500&amp;w=342&amp;sz=57&amp;tbnid=or-Jju16bSmqYM:&amp;tbnh=130&amp;tbnw=89&amp;prev=/images%3Fq%3Dsinbad&amp;zoom=1&amp;q=sinbad&amp;usg=__Akp1R0nMZ020pzOAxdtBCH7lGnA=&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=dTJITdfkGYH7lwfdk7S3BA&amp;ved=0CHoQ9QEwDA" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sinbad of the Seven Seas</a>!  Congrats on your blue!</td>', 'How handsome you are as none other than Sinbad of the Seven Seas!  Congrats on your blue!', '2011-02-01 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
